        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle BF-02 - Inventory Quality &amp; Defective Goods Handling\n\n|Inventory Staff|\nstart\n:Identify defective goods;\n:Record defect information;\n\n|WMSD|\n:Isolate affected quantity;\n:Update inventory status;\n:Store defect evidence and origin;\n\n|Inventory Staff|\n:Propose disposition;\n\n|WMSD|\n:Record proposed disposition;\n\n|Store Owner|\n:Review proposed disposition;\n\nif (Disposition approved?) then (Yes)\n\n  |WMSD|\n  :Record approval decision;\n\n  |Inventory Staff|\n  :Post approved disposition;\n\n  |WMSD|\n  :Update inventory quantity\n  and final stock status;\n  :Record movement history;\n\nelse (No)\n\n  |WMSD|\n  :Record rejection decision;\n\n  |Inventory Staff|\n  :Revise proposed disposition;\n\nendif\n\nstop\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="Mg7-1xn4GYk_vAg2I9Hz-1">
