        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle BF-03 - Warehouse Transfer\n\n|Inventory Staff|\nstart\n:Create warehouse transfer;\n\n|WMSD|\n:Record source warehouse,\ndestination warehouse, lot and quantity;\n\n|Inventory Staff|\n:Record transfer dispatch;\n\n|WMSD|\n:Reduce usable stock at source;\n:Set quantity to In Transit;\n\n|Inventory Staff|\n:Record transfer handover;\n:Record destination receipt;\n\n|WMSD|\n:Compare dispatched and received quantities;\n\nif (Transfer discrepancy found?) then (Yes)\n\n  |Inventory Staff|\n  :Record transfer discrepancy;\n  :Create resolution request;\n\n  |WMSD|\n  :Keep transfer open;\n  :Record discrepancy details;\n\n  |Store Owner|\n  :Review resolution request;\n\n  if (Resolution approved?) then (Yes)\n\n    |WMSD|\n    :Record approval decision;\n\n    |Inventory Staff|\n    :Record resolution outcome;\n\n    |WMSD|\n    :Update destination inventory;\n    :Close transfer;\n\n  else (No)\n\n    |WMSD|\n    :Keep transfer unresolved;\n\n  endif\n\nelse (No)\n\n  |WMSD|\n  :Increase inventory at destination;\n  :Close transfer;\n\nendif\n\nstop\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="6BGEC7PdEzq-N2MWfqSk-1">
